Question 1 - SantaClawz asks who was the voice
Bran Heard in his head?

00:00:51.329 --> 00:00:55.590
He was hearing the voice of the three eyed
raven, also known as the green seer. You can

00:00:55.590 --> 00:01:00.989
think of greenseer's as like extra powerful
wargs with power over all of nature. It works

00:01:00.989 --> 00:01:05.269
a little differently from warging, but once
Bran finds him I think the show will explain

00:01:05.269 --> 00:01:06.870
it in greater detail.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:11.560
We actually know a lot about the greenseer
himself, he used to be called the Bloodraven

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:16.230
and when he was alive his real name was Brynden
Rivers. He was the son of Aegon Targaryen

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:20.230
the Fourth and a Blackwood. The Blackwoods
are from the Riverlands, so that's why his

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.570
bastard name is Rivers and not Blackfyre.

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:29.510
