00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:38.940
Question 2 - Zalod asks Will we see Euron
Greyjoy this season?

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:42.670
The strange thing about the Ironborn this
season is that they might just end up showing

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.620
Theon's sister and her force of men. Since
they're near Moat Cailin and that's where

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.780
Ramsay is headed, with Theon. Euron doesn't
