00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:23.870
Question 7 - lizbet says What about when The
Red Viper "kindly" reminds Cersei that Myrcella

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.220
is still living in Dorne.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.140
I didn't have a lot of room in my review
video so I had to leave this part out, but

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:35.240
yes, it was really cool. It sounded like Oberyn
was suggesting that Myrcella was safe from

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:40.090
all the awfuleness by being in Dorne. But
at the same time, it could have also been

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:44.930
a threat, as in Myrcella was in Dorne and
was at their mercy and could be subjected

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:49.500
to all those things if the Martells wanted.
Prince Doran is actually one of the more level

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:54.960
headed Martells, so I don't think they'd
ever officially hurt Myrcella. She's actually

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.710
