to learn more about his dead sister.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:13.500
Question 8 - David Macdowell Blue asks what
do you think Cersei is going to be like now?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:20.140
Cersei was on a tear in this episode, way
before Joffrey died. One of my favorite moments

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:25.310
was when that servant girl came up and muttered
under her breath to Maester Pycelle and Cersei

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:29.320
interrupts her and just says GO SEE Qyburn.
If you didn't catch it, she's just talking

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:35.790
about getting an abortion. Cersei had been
talking about using Qyburn for sleep aides

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:40.580
too, just implying that he was the shady Doctor
to go see if you wanted crazy drugs.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:44.970
After this she's going to be in mourning
for a few episodes and just horrible to everyone

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:48.910
around her. More so than usual.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.830
 

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.500
 

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.640
In general, things will probably just keep
getting shittier and shittier for her.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:59.000
Question 9 - Lady Zelda asks Is Jack Gleeson
now going off to complete his education?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.430
He talked about wanting to quit acting and
pursue higher education as a career path.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:06.650
He and his friends do a puppet show on the
side, when Game of Thrones isn't filming.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:10.520
I don't think he'll ever completely leave
the performing arts, he'll still do creative

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:14.930
things. But he probably won't try to star
in another television series.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:19.750
David Benioff and DB Weiss said that they
wouldn't be surprised if he became a professor

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:24.130
eventually. So it sounds like he might just
enroll in a PhD program sometime in the near

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:28.670
future. You might be able to take a class
taught by Professor Joffrey someday.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:32.800
